r <b>WtF </b>as we are already 1 year past between <b>The Pack</b> and general OPP supplement production time is now about 2 years. It can rise even longer cause, you know, we do not have main <b>Forsaken</b> line developer to stir the project...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-21-2017, 01:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T22:22:29-07:00","id":1132075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1130344-abandoned-game-is-abandoned?p=1132070#post1132070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That I like many authors writing stuff does not mean I'm glad that Werewolf do not have 'it's own DaveB' - line should be run by person knowing it and proposing supplements. Other way we end like now situation, with WtF setting 1,5 year without it's own book even announced...</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I'm sorry, I thought we just got confirmation of at least two books coming.<br /> <br /> Stop looking for clouds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-20T22:27:31-07:00","id":1132078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1130344-abandoned-game-is-abandoned?p=1132073#post1132073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Remember that all that time Rose was main developer of the <b>Requiem</b>, looking over the project.<br /> <br /> So we may look even for 4 years for <b>WtF </b>as we are already 1 year past between <b>The Pack</b> and general OPP supplement production time is now about 2 years. It can rise even longer cause, you know, we do not have main <b>Forsaken</b> line developer to stir the project...</div> </div> </div> </div>Or Shunned by the Moon could have a production cycle similar to Enemy Action, which has gone from Frist Drafts to Development in 3 months and could easily be out within 6 months of us first knowing about it. <br /> <br /> You're panicking Wyrd, you need to chill out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>